 "markdown": "**HDFC Bank** is an Indian banking and financial services company headquartered in **Mumbai**, and it is India\u2019s largest private sector bank by assets and market capitalization.[1][5]\n\nA few key points:\n- It began operations in **January 1995** after receiving RBI approval in 1994.[5][11]\n- Its services cover **wholesale banking** and **retail banking**, including loans, deposits, cards, payments, and wealth-related services.[5][7][11]\n- It was promoted by **Housing Development Finance Corporation (HDFC)** and later merged with HDFC Ltd. in **2023**.[8][12]\n- By market size, sources describe it as among the **largest banks in the world**, with one source calling it the **10th-largest by market capitalization** as of 2025.[1][10]\n\nIf you want, I can also give you:\n- a **company profile**\n- **latest share price / financial highlights**\n- **history and merger details**\n- **banking products and services**",
